   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>“At this distance you'll also have to take the Coriolis Effect into account. Or let that francy-pantsy scope do it for you, your call.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Requires Sniping Scope or Smart Scope with installed TeleOptics.</strong> When performing a Single Shot or Aimed Shot Attack on a target 51m/yds or further away, if the user Takes Extra Time or makes a successful Complementary Skill Check to assist themselves or another user, the bonus they receive/provide is increased by 1 (+2 Total).</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Scopes &amp; Sights).</em></p>"
